; Class references, class methods and class variables (--mode=objfpc): the
; parse tree and checked tree of class of T, class var sections (ended by
; var), class methods and their implementations.
; RUN: %pcc --mode=objfpc --emit-parse-tree %S/Inputs/classrefs.pas -o %t.tree
; RUN: diff %S/Inputs/classrefs.tree %t.tree
; RUN: %pcc --mode=objfpc --emit-ast %S/Inputs/classrefs.pas -o %t.ast
; RUN: diff %S/Inputs/classrefs.ast %t.ast
